2 CONT Nicoline Sophie Caspary was born on June 11th, 1830.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicoline Sophie CASPARY was the ILLEGITIMATE CHILD of Nicolai CASPARY and Karen ANDERSDATTER. Nicoline was born on 11 Jun 1830. Karen died in June 1830.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicolai CASPARY then married Anne Kirstine BORRESEN MOLLER on 07 Oct 1830. It is believed Anne would have raised Nicoline along with three other children they had in 1832, 1834, and 1839.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT Birth record, Rikshospitalet, Oslo, Norway, p.199
2 CONT
2 CONT Church christening record: Rikshospitalet, Oslo, Norway, parish records (official), p. 199, #22, mother of illegitimate child, Karen Andersdatter, father is said to be Nicolai Caspary, born 11 June, 1830, christened 21 June 1830, 
2 CONC witnesses: Madame Brien, Ingeborg Andersdatter and the goldsmith's apprentice, Christian Andersen
