1 NAME Ingeborg Sara Eugenie Marie Sommerfeldt
2 GIVN Ingeborg Sara Eugenie Marie Sommerfeldt
2 NICK Bolly
2 NICK Broch
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 9 FEB 1800
