1 NOTE {geni:about_me} HEIBERG
2 CONT
2 CONT 58-J. F. Heiberg *) is born in Bergen, Norway, 4th of July 1861. He
2 CONT
2 CONT emigrated from Norway in the spring of 1881 and came to Minneapolis, Minn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Shortle afterwards he went to Dane Co., Wis., and stayed there for a year.
2 CONT
2 CONT After that he went to Minnesota, and came here to Norman Co., where he
2 CONT
2 CONT bought the mill from Peter O. Skjægrud in Town of Wild Rice. The 18th
2 CONT
2 CONT January 1884 he was married to the maid Augusta Slettebakken. He has 5
2 CONT
2 CONT children. With regard to the new mill by Heiberg it can be added : It was
2 CONT
2 CONT erected in 1882 and was 30 x 40, 3 floors height. In 1890 it was completely
2 CONT
2 CONT changed to roller mill. In 1892 it was improved, enlarged and added 10 feet,
2 CONT
2 CONT so it now is 30x50. The addition is used for rinsing and storing wheat. The
2 CONT
2 CONT mill also has its own Feed Department with excellent rinsing apparatus.
2 CONT
2 CONT Before we got the bridge across the river, there was a ferry on which one
2 CONT
2 CONT transported the wheat across the river. The mosquitos were so many those
2 CONT
2 CONT days, that when one wiped the face with the hand, it was filled of
2 CONT
2 CONT mosquitos. More to conclusion about Heibergs Park. Note from Håkon: *) J. F.
2 CONT
2 CONT Heiberg = Jørgen Faye Heiberg, born 4th July, bapt. 4th Aug 1861 in
2 CONT
2 CONT Nykirken, Bergen, parents : merchant Andreas Heiberg and wife Else Catharine
2 CONT
2 CONT Reutsch born Faye, married in the Cathedral of Bergen on 18th Nov 1849,
2 CONT
2 CONT father was at that time 29 and mother 22 1/4 years old. Digitalarkivet
2 CONT
2 CONT Emigrants from Bergen 1874-1930 says that Jørgen Faye Heiberg,19 years old,
2 CONT
2 CONT emigrated from Bergen 7th May 1880 with State Line
2 CONT
2 CONT This is more info, but I couldn't get it copied on here:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.info.co.clay.mn.us/History/Heiberg,%20Jorgen%20F.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sources==
