2 CONT
2 CONT Howard was the youngest son of Margaret Charlotte Howard, 2nd Baroness Strathcona and Mount Royal and brother of the 3rd Baron. He was Mayor of Westminster for 1936–1937. He was Conservative Member of Parliament (MP) for Westminst
2 CONC er St George's from 1945 to 1950.
2 CONT
2 CONT Through his wife, Lady Leonora Stanley Baldwin, Howard was the son-in-law of British Prime Minister Stanley Baldwin and Lucy Baldwin, Countess Baldwin of Bewdley.
