1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.ics.uci.edu/~dan/genealogy/Krakow/Families/Pamm.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Owner of a watch-fabrication plant in Geneve, Switzerland:
2 CONT
2 CONT Lusina Watch Company, Lusina Watch Factory
2 CONT
2 CONT A. Pamm	Watches; Zurich, Switzerland; registered on 14.12.1917
2 CONT
2 CONT A. Pamm Vve. & Fils	Watches; Zurich, Switzerland; registered on 06.01.1922
2 CONT
2 CONT Vve. de A. Pamm & Fils Watches; Zurich, Switzerland; registered on 04.01.1923
2 CONT
2 CONT Pamm Freres SARL	Watches; Geneva, Switzerland; registered on 5.22.1929
2 CONT
2 CONT Pamm Frères / Montres Lusina SARL	Clocks, alarm clocks, Geneva, Switzerland; registered on 8.29.1935
2 CONT
2 CONT The Lusina watch company is known to have shown ring watches at the 1939 Swiss National Exhibition. The company was known as Pamm Frères prior to 1935 and was listed as Pamm Frères, Montres Lusina, S.a.r.l , in 1966.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.mytravelwatches.com/#4 http://styleintime.com/Vintage-Watches/MANUFACTURE-L-to-Z/Lusina-Geneve
2 CONT
2 CONT Tore Pamm: André's father and his uncle, Jacub (Jaques) Pamm, were running the watch company, Lusina, until 1972 when the father of Andre and his mother died in a car crash on their way for holidays in France. As his uncle was old
2 CONC  at that time, and Andre who had worked with them for several years, had started to work in Banking some years before, they sold the company to one of their most important clients living in Iran, and I think that was the end of Lu
2 CONC sina.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.imsig.pl/pozycja/2006/14/762,Wnioskodawca_Pamm_Claude_Andre_i_inni
2 CONT
2 CONT District Court for Kraków-Downtown announces that at the request of Claude Andre Pamm, liana Krafft, Georges Pamm, Very Pamm-Milhaud was initiated proceedings under file no. And Ns 1031/05/S act of declaration of inheritance after
2 CONC  Pamm Jacob, son of Abraham and Rivka home Frankel, born on December 21, 1895 in Krakow, recently residing in Geneva (Switzerland), and here the deceased on August 28, 1987 r - for shares in the ownership of real estate located in
2 CONC  Poland Street. Sebastian in Krakow, covered by Unbreakable Paper No 1404 Krakow-Stradom kept by the District Court for Krakow-foothills and at ul. Saree in Krakow, covered by Unbreakable Paper No. KR1P/00018487/1 kept by the Dist
2 CONC rict Court for Krakow-Foothills. The Court urges the heirs of the deceased, within a period of six months from the release date announcement volunteered at the local courthouse and proved of inheritance, as otherwise may be ignore
2 CONC d in the decision on the acquisition of the inheritance of Jacob Pamm.
