2 CONC =540643681&itemId=1364220-&groupId=ce40d479e72e72d96e372baedd16c24a&action=showRecord&recordTitle=Christian+Fr.+Mathiesen"&amp;gt;Christian Fr. Mathiesen&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;; 29. jan 1897;  Record 10732:1364219-:ce40d479e72e72d96e37
