1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Note on Eleonore &amp;amp; Einar's Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleonore Kristine AABYE died on February 25th, 1915; she was 41 years old, leaving Einar CASPARY with their four young children: Gerda (11), Norma (9), Einar II (6), and Ruth (5).
2 CONT
2 CONT Einar CASPARY married Augusta FIELD around 1916 (need to find certificate), becoming the stepmother of the four young children Eleonore left behind. Gerda (12), Norma (10), Einar II (7), Ruth (6). They are all listed as living tog
2 CONC ether on the 1920 U.S. Federal Census.
