2 CONC ps.google.com/groups?q=william+robertson+group:soc.genealogy.surnames.britain+group:soc.genealogy.surnames.britain&start=10&hl=en&lr=&ie=UTF-8&group=soc.genealogy.surnames.britain&selm=5qrps2%24mc3%40bl-4.rootsweb.com&rnum=20
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://gw0.geneanet.org/brynjulf?lang=en&pz=tor&nz=langballe&ocz=0&p=james&n=robertson&oc=1
2 CONT
2 CONT I have the following inforamtion: doctor William Robertson married 1792 to Katharine Ingles at Dunfermline. They had 3 children: Mary born 1795 at Inverness, Charles born 5th of April 1801 at Inverness, and Amelia Lamont born 1803
2 CONC  at Inverness. I know from family records in Norway that the family moved by boat from Glasgow to London when my GG grandfather Charles Robertson was a small child. Katharine Ingles was by then thought to be a widow. Charles worke
2 CONC d in the Norwegian General Consulat in London and moved to Hammerfest Norway and I have extensive information on his descendants in Norway. I would very much like information on William and Katharine's anchestry and on what happen
2 CONC ed to the two daughters Mary and Amelia Lamont.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://gw0.geneanet.org/brynjulf?lang=no;pz=tor;nz=langballe;ocz=0;p=william;n=robertson;oc=1
